        <!-- ===== Hang annotation ===== -->
        <mxCell id="hang-note" value="KNOWN CONSTRAINT &#8212; snowbook shutdown hang&#xa;&#xa;EXECUTE NOTEBOOK is SYNCHRONOUS, so the task&#xa;blocks for the notebook's whole lifetime.&#xa;&#xa;On MULTI-FILE runs the notebook finishes every cell&#xa;and writes its rows, then snowbook's script runner&#xa;waits forever in on_scriptrunner_ready while the main&#xa;thread serves gRPC &#8594; ~8,100s transport timeout.&#xa;&#xa;0/8 single-file runs hung &#183; 4/6 multi-file runs hung&#xa;Root-caused 2026-08-19 via faulthandler stacks.&#xa;Mitigation: 30-min task timeout caps the waste.&#xa;Fix: port to headless EXECUTE JOB SERVICE." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE7F6;strokeColor=#7254A3;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="440" width="270" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

